    "created_at": "2017-05-11T13:13:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-11T13:13:20Z",
    "body": "Since U+0000 requires special attention in the tokenizer even in an implementation that does not report errors, I'd prefer to keep U+0000 error reporting in the tokenizer in order to keep the error together with the special action.\r\n\r\nI suggest excluding it in the preprocessing stage with a note saying that the error happens in the tokenizer.",
